OL,3,GNEWSAFlying Start brand to be ditched
OL,4,Afor childcare for two-year-olds in
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government has asked councils
OL,8,Fto rebrand the childcare they provide
OL,9,Ffor two-year-olds, dropping the name
OL,10,FFlying Start.
OL,12,FIn the guidance, ministers told local
OL,13,Fauthorities to start using the term
OL,14,F"Welsh government-funded childcare".
OL,16,FHowever, Flying Start's other services
OL,17,F- such as its health visiting provision
OL,18,F- will remain with the same name,
OL,19,Faccording to the guidance.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
